# Planning Hover Performance (ABSOLUTE — DO NOT REMOVE)

**Owner mandate (2026-08-31):** Live F5 planning must stay responsive (~120 FPS reference). Agents have **removed this perf architecture twice** while chasing "SSOT purity." That is forbidden.

**This is NOT a second truth path.** Same commit slots and sealed bundle at ratify. Only **when** expensive work runs differs between live hover and QA/commit flush.

## Required live F5 behavior (`CombatPlanningInput`)

| Mechanism | Purpose | Code anchors |
|-----------|---------|--------------|
| **Hover sim throttle** | `_schedule_hover_sim_refresh` + `hover_sim_interval_sec` (~45ms) + pointer-still | `on_hover_moved`, `_should_run_hover_sim_sync`, `_HOVER_SIM_MIN_INTERVAL_SEC` |
| **Sync only when needed** | QA (`qa_static_overlay`), occupy-push, commit flush | `_should_run_hover_sim_sync`, `_flush_hover_heavy_sync` |
| **Cheap empty-walk preview** | Board clone from same slots — skip `Simulator.simulate` on live hover | `_hover_can_preview_move_without_simulate`, `_preview_from_commit_slots_at_cell` |
| **Cheap occupy-push preview** | Same pattern for allied push hovers | `_hover_can_preview_occupy_push_without_simulate` |

## Forbidden (instant violation — even for "SSOT cleanup")

| Do not | Why |
|--------|-----|
| Call `_refresh_voluntary_walk_hover_preview` / full settle **synchronously in `on_hover_moved` per cell** | Restores slideshow FPS |
| Make `_should_run_hover_sim_sync` return **true for live basic move** (`selected_ability_index < 0`) | Disables throttle |
| Remove `_hover_can_preview_move_without_simulate` or always call `preview_actions` on live hover | Full sim every pixel |
| Skip `_run_hover_sim_refresh` in `_flush_hover_heavy_sync` before commit | Commit without settled bundle |
| Label throttle or cheap preview as "heuristic" and delete | Owner-approved scheduling exception (`minimal-performance-impact.mdc`) |

## SSOT compatibility (must remain true)

- Hover still builds **the same commit slots**; commit **ratifies the sealed bundle** — no re-path at click.
- QA headless (`qa_static_overlay`) **always** runs full sim on hover — cheap path returns false there.
- Overlay still reads **bundle only** — no live tile fallback when bundle missing.

## Before editing `combat_planning_input.gd` hover paths

1. Grep `PERF GUARD` in the file — do not delete those blocks without owner approval.
2. Read this rule + `docs/design/planning/MOVE_PREVIEW_RULES.md` § Preview = commit.
3. If removing perf code, **stop** and propose to owner — default is **keep perf, fix SSOT upstream**.

